<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25948" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστροφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twisting,</i> of a fractured
			limb, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <i>distortion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				46
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὀμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					958a6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				960a20
			</span></i>: abs., of limbs, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.111
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>perversion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1227a21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δήμου ἐπὶ τὸ χεῖρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.21.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.520c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κακή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>distraction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.7
			</span></i>; <i>madness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>tergiversation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				17.8.1
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
